<title>USA: U.S. DAP, ammonia prices flat, some ammonia demand.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, ammonia prices flat, some ammonia demand.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diammonium phosphate and ammonia values were unchanged Monday, with some dealers reporting activity in the ammonia market.</p>
<p>&quot;It's been resonably quiet, although availability is limited,&quot; a dealer said.</p>
<p>Production slowdowns and outages at several U.S. ammonia plants have supported prices.</p>
<p>				   Dlrs/short ton   Chg from Wednesday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla		172		     unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  186-188		 unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		175		     unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
